  "slug": "catering-order-post-event-review-form",
  "title": "Catering Order Post-Event Review Form",
  "subtitle": "Close the delivery: reconcile food, labor, mileage, and rental cost against the quote, measure delivery-window performance, and record client feedback.",
  "description": "An original post-delivery review for off-premise catering. It reconciles quoted against actual cost across food, labor, transport, and rentals, measures the delivery window and setup against plan, records the client outcome, opens actions for findings, and captures the learning that should change the next catering order.",
  "use_case": "Use after a catering delivery when catering and accounting must agree on actual cost against the quote, and when the team needs to know whether the site plan held. The review closes when billing is agreed and every finding has an owner.",
  "risk_tier": "A",
