            "Delivered-count exceptions from the register applied to the invoice",
            "Rental charges and shortfalls reconciled to the inventory log",
            "Travel and on-site hours reconciled to the crew register",
            "Equipment loss or damage charges supported by recovery attempts",
            "Approved remediation or adjustments applied with a reference",
            "Final invoice reviewed with the ordering contact"
          ]
        }
      ]
