            "Arrival fell inside the agreed delivery window",
            "Site access matched what the order described",
            "Arrival temperature readings stayed within the venue standard",
            "Setup completed before the service start time",
            "Restricted portions were handed to a named person and confirmed",
            "Returnable equipment came back on the same trip"
          ]
        },
